Package: xwayland-satellite
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         xwayland (>= 2:23.1)
Description: rootless Xwayland for Wayland compositors (Lulo OS build)
 xwayland-satellite grants rootless Xwayland integration to any Wayland
 compositor implementing xdg_wm_base and viewporter. niri starts it on
 demand so X11 applications work in its sessions.
 .
 This is Lulo OS's build of the unmodified upstream release, made because
 xwayland-satellite is not in the Ubuntu archive.
